# Cloudflare Pages static rewrites.
#
# `/program` must open the programme page on its own. Next.js serves files in
# `public/` at the root but does not resolve a directory index, so
# `public/program/index.html` is reachable at `/program/index.html` and nowhere
# else. That URL was handed to Google's publishing review, and a link that has
# to carry `.html` reads as unfinished.
#
# The `200` matters: a bare redirect would send the visitor to the `.html` URL
# and change the address bar. A rewrite serves the file while keeping the clean
# path, which is the whole point.
/program  /program/index.html  200
